  "title": "Triumph Launches Unified Brand",
  "summary": "Rebranding consolidates transportation solutions under one brand with a fresh new look and the same commitment to customers — Transact Confidently DALLAS – June 3, 2025 – Triumph Financial, Inc. (Nasdaq: TFIN) today announced the launch of its evolved brand identity and tagline, Triumph. The move brings together its transportation-focused brands — TriumphPay, Triumph Factoring, […]",
